      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Thank you for the request!\n\nYou mention the following:\n\n> A better model would be to make creator-to-creator spending of earned Credits very cheap\n\nCreator-to-creator transactions aren't supported (yet). Do you think VRChat would have to introduce creator-to-creator (or user-to-user) transactions first? Or are you referring to something else?",
